#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Giant Eagles can fly."
msgid "Giant Eagles can be ridden only by Druids."
msgstr "Les Aigles Géants peuvent voler."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:144
msgid "An Eagle can fly, increasing its rider’s move from 60 to 100cm."
msgstr ""
"Un Aigle Géant peut voler, il augmente donc le mouvement de son cavalier de "
"60 à 100 cm."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:146
msgid "It adds +2 Attacks to those of its rider."
msgstr "Il ajoute également +2 Attaques au profil de son cavalier."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[chariot-mount,†5]]5. Chariot Mount"
msgstr "[[chariot-mount,†5]]5. Char Monté"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:149
msgid "Generals, Druids and Heroes can ride Chariots."
msgstr "Les Généraux, les Druides et les Héros peuvent monter sur un Char."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:151
msgid "An extra +1 Attack is added to those of its rider."
msgstr "Ce qui ajoute +1 Attaque à leur profil."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:152
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[fenbeast,†6]]6. Fenbeast"
msgstr "[[fenbeast,†6]]6. Bêtes des marais"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:156
msgid ""
"A Fenbeast is an individual troop unit, but it is not fielded in the "
"standard way. Fenbeasts appear on the battlefield only after a Druid casts "
"the Summon Fenbeast spell."
msgstr ""
"Les Bêtes des marais forment une unité à part entière, mais ne sont pas "
"alignées sur le champ de bataille de la manière habituelle. Elles sont "
"invoquées par un Druide en lançant le sort d’Invocation de Bêtes des marais."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:163
msgid ""
"A Fenbeast cannot be brigaded with other troop units, not even other "
"Fenbeasts. Fenbeasts never use their initiative to move in the Command "
"phase. Because they are completely dominated by the will of the Druid who "
"summoned them, that Druid counts as having a Command value of +1 when "
"commanding the Fenbeast – that is 8 rather than 7."
msgstr ""
"Une Bête des marais ne peut former une brigade avec d’autres unités, même d’"
"autres Bêtes des marais. Elles n’utilisent jamais l’initiative pour bouger "
"lors de la Phase d’Ordre. Les Druides ont une valeur de Commandement "
"augmentée de +1 quand ils donnent des ordres aux Bêtes des marais, c’est-à-"
"dire 8 au lieu de 7, car elles sont entièrement dominées par la volonté de "
"ceux qui les ont invoquées."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:168
msgid ""
"Fenbeasts can move through bogs as though they were open terrain. Unlike the "
"wild Bog Beasts from the ‘Dark Shadows’ campaign, Fenbeasts will make way "
"for friendly troops."
msgstr ""
"Les Bêtes des marais peuvent traverser les marais comme si c’était du "
"terrain dégagé, et peut laisser passer les unités alliées de la manière "
"habituelle."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:170
msgid "A Fenbeast causes terror in its enemies."
msgstr "Les Bêtes des marais provoquent la terreur."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/albion.adoc:174
#, no-wrap
msgid "Albion spells"
msgstr "Sorts d'Albion"

#. type: Title ===
